    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77169" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάν</span></b> , gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾱνός</span>, dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾱνί</span> (un
			contr.
		
