				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάονι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(2).556
				</span></i>
			 (Melpea, <span class="entity">vi B. C.</span>)), ὁ,
				<u>Pan</u>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾶνα δέ μιν καλέεσκον, ὅτι φρένα
					πᾶσιν ἔτερψεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Hom.</u>
					19.47
