			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.105
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ Πὰν Ἀρκαδίας μεδέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					95
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.123
			</span></i>, etc.; 
